00:39:02,520 --> 00:39:08,780
The temptation in your life, the temptations in your life are no different from what others experience.

362
00:39:08,780 --> 00:39:10,560
And God is faithful.

363
00:39:10,560 --> 00:39:14,180
We have to remember the next time that we drive up to the ABC store,

364
00:39:14,180 --> 00:39:18,940
or we want to smoke that cigarette, or we want to talk to that person that we really shouldn't be talking to,

365
00:39:18,940 --> 00:39:22,100
we have to remember that God is faithful.

366
00:39:22,100 --> 00:39:27,520
And maybe it's our turn to get down and kneel to the ground in the dirt because Christ did it for us

367
00:39:27,520 --> 00:39:29,840
until those temptations go away.

368
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:33,580
He will not allow the temptation to be more than what you can stand.

369
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:39,960
And when you are tempted, he will show you a way out so that you can endure and keep on enduring.

370
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:42,440
In 1 Thessalonians 5, 6,

371
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:48,620
So then, let us not sleep as others do, but let us stay awake and be sober and alert.

372
00:39:48,620 --> 00:39:51,060
Remember who our real enemy is.

373
00:39:51,060 --> 00:39:53,240
People are not our enemies.

374
00:39:53,240 --> 00:39:59,440
We have a real enemy out there, and he is on the prowl like a hungry lion waiting to devour you in your moments of weakness.

375
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:05,620
Galatians 4, 13 tells us that we can do everything through Christ who gives us strength.

376
00:40:05,620 --> 00:40:11,120
You set your mind to it, you take captive those thoughts, and you believe Jesus when he says that you can overcome.

377
00:40:11,120 --> 00:40:14,960
It is by his stripes, it is by his wounds that we have been healed.

378
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:16,680
In Romans 8, 11,

379
00:40:16,680 --> 00:40:20,360
If the spirit of him who raised Jesus from the dead dwells inside of you,

380
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:25,320
he who raised Christ Jesus from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies

381
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:29,540
through the same spirit that dwells and lives inside of you.

382
00:40:30,060 --> 00:40:31,660
God's spirit lives inside of you.

383
00:40:31,660 --> 00:40:35,940
The same spirit that raised Jesus from the dead, you have access to.

384
00:40:35,940 --> 00:40:38,040
Luke 10, 19,

385
00:40:38,040 --> 00:40:43,300
Behold, I have given you authority to tread on serpents and scorpions and over all the power of the enemy,

386
00:40:43,300 --> 00:40:44,940
and nothing will hurt you.

387
00:40:44,940 --> 00:40:48,800
And finally, as we wrap up today's message,

388
00:40:50,100 --> 00:40:54,240
we'll go back to the fruits of the Spirit.

389
00:40:54,240 --> 00:40:57,220
Galatians 5, 19 through 25.

390
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:58,940
It says,

391
00:40:58,940 --> 00:41:01,480
The acts of the flesh are obvious.

392
00:41:01,480 --> 00:41:20,600
Sexual immorality, impurity and debauchery, idolatry and witchcraft, hatred, discord, jealousy, fits of rage, selfish ambition, dissensions, factions, and envy, drunkenness, orgies, and the like.

393
00:41:20,600 --> 00:41:28,100
And I warn you, as I warn you, as I did before, that those who live like this will not inherit the kingdom of God.

394
00:41:28,100 --> 00:41:39,380
But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness, and self-control.

395
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:42,540
But against such things there is no law.

396
00:41:42,540 --> 00:41:49,240
Those who belong to Christ Jesus have crucified the flesh with its passions and desires.

397
00:41:49,240 --> 00:41:54,380
And since we live by the spirit of God, let us keep in step with the spirit.

398
00:41:54,380 --> 00:42:01,540
Let us not become conceited, provoking, and envying each other.

399
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:10,160
Church, I'm going to ask you today, what in your life are you trying to control outside of you?

400
00:42:10,160 --> 00:42:11,700
Is it your marriage?

401
00:42:11,700 --> 00:42:12,520
Is it your husband?

402
00:42:12,520 --> 00:42:14,020
Is it somebody else's addiction?

403
00:42:14,020 --> 00:42:18,340
Maybe you have convinced yourself that this is just the way it is.

404
00:42:18,340 --> 00:42:19,900
This is just who I am.

405
00:42:19,900 --> 00:42:27,420
I challenge you to take captive those thoughts and align them with what God's word says about you and believe them.

406
00:42:29,340 --> 00:42:35,040
And then evaluate what areas in your life are completely out of control, unruly.

407
00:42:35,040 --> 00:42:39,000
And what areas are you needing to stop giving into your emotions?

408
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:45,640
Stop being led by your feelings and trust in the word of God and the spirit of God.

409
00:42:45,640 --> 00:42:51,700
Knowing and believing that God is faithful and he will rescue you and he will restore you and he will finish every good thing that he starts.

410
00:42:51,700 --> 00:42:58,680
All you have to do is bring it to him and ask him for that deliverance, for that refuge, for that rest.

411
00:42:58,680 --> 00:43:07,660
And finally, if you have never asked or invited Jesus to come into your heart, into your life, to be your personal Lord and Savior,

412
00:43:07,660 --> 00:43:10,460
I challenge you to consider that today.

413
00:43:10,460 --> 00:43:18,840
Consider a life with Christ, a life fueled by the spirit of God, surrendering all the stress, all the clutter,

414
00:43:19,060 --> 00:43:31,400
all the pressures of this life, and just trusting God with it all, giving all of your control over to him, believing him, and experiencing that full life in abundance.

415
00:43:31,400 --> 00:43:33,720
Will you all stand with me today?

416
00:43:35,720 --> 00:43:40,840
Every head bowed, eyes closed, brothers and sisters, hear me out.

417
00:43:40,840 --> 00:43:44,800
We are living in a world that is unfolding of Christ's return.

418
00:43:45,600 --> 00:43:56,280
Jesus not only died for your sins, but he rose again to promise you the gift of his Holy Spirit that will empower you to live out heaven on earth right here, right now.

419
00:43:56,280 --> 00:44:01,180
In your homes, in your workspaces, in your schools, in your marriages, with your children.

420
00:44:01,180 --> 00:44:07,320
Everywhere you go, you can bring a blessing upon not only yourself, but the people around you.

421
00:44:08,580 --> 00:44:10,900
Christ is coming back one day.

422
00:44:10,900 --> 00:44:13,240
We don't know when, but he will return.

423
00:44:13,240 --> 00:44:19,300
Why not take hold of those promises right here, right now, until that day comes?

424
00:44:19,300 --> 00:44:24,520
Dear Heavenly Father, we are so grateful for your presence in this room.

425
00:44:24,520 --> 00:44:25,960
We are so grateful for your children.

426
00:44:25,960 --> 00:44:34,040
We're so grateful for this opportunity to fellowship, to just take in your word, to chew on it, to savor it.

427
00:44:34,160 --> 00:44:38,560
I pray, God, that you are just removing hearts of stone in this place today.

428
00:44:38,560 --> 00:44:43,180
I pray, God, that you are refueling passions and fire that have burned out.

429
00:44:43,180 --> 00:44:48,160
I just pray, God, that you are restoring marriages and families in this house today.

430
00:44:48,160 --> 00:44:52,960
I pray, God, that you are rekindling people and their relationship and their faith walk with you.

431
00:44:52,960 --> 00:44:58,240
That we do not have to deconstruct our faith, God, but we just need to re-self-evaluate.

432
00:44:58,240 --> 00:45:00,940
That you are God and you are good.

433
00:45:00,940 --> 00:45:03,400
And that, Jesus, you are the only way.

434
00:45:04,160 --> 00:45:06,600
That we don't have to perform for miracles.

435
00:45:06,600 --> 00:45:09,460
That we don't have to perform for joy.

436
00:45:09,460 --> 00:45:12,980
We don't have to live in an artificial, superficial lighting.

437
00:45:12,980 --> 00:45:15,000
We don't have to wear a mask.

438
00:45:15,000 --> 00:45:17,720
We can just simply come together and be ourselves.

439
00:45:17,720 --> 00:45:23,000
And you say that we are an imperfect people who serve a really good, perfect God.

440
00:45:23,000 --> 00:45:29,220
And that he takes our ashes and he brings us back to life and makes all things beautiful.

441
00:45:30,180 --> 00:45:34,300
God, you know the weights that we carry throughout the week, throughout the days.

442
00:45:34,300 --> 00:45:38,300
You know the thoughts that taunt us day in and day out.

443
00:45:38,300 --> 00:45:42,880
And God, I just pray that we have the strength to lay them down at the foot of the cross today.

444
00:45:43,640 --> 00:45:45,660
That we pick up our own crosses.

445
00:45:45,660 --> 00:45:55,320
That we would just lay down anything that does not serve you, that does not please you, or serve your kingdom or your people or our brothers and sisters in Christ.

446
00:45:55,320 --> 00:45:59,680
May we not allow ourselves to be tricked or fooled by the enemy.

447
00:45:59,680 --> 00:46:03,820
May we not partake of things that cause one another to stumble.

448
00:46:03,980 --> 00:46:13,780
May we keep our eyes on you and run this race to the fullest with our best effort and energy, with full passion and full hearts on fire for you, Lord.

449
00:46:13,780 --> 00:46:18,840
So that one day we can look you in the eye and hear, well done, my good and faithful servants.

450
00:46:18,840 --> 00:46:20,620
We love you, Jesus.

451
00:46:20,620 --> 00:46:26,280
And we're so excited for this beautiful thing that you are doing in each of us and in our community.

452
00:46:26,280 --> 00:46:28,240
We love you so much.

453
00:46:28,240 --> 00:46:29,860
In Jesus' name, amen.

454
00:46:29,860 --> 00:46:30,640
Amen.
